t it\u2019s always more fun than being formal and tight."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "So join me in my wild mental spree,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Where normality has no place, it's free."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "For losing yourself in your head and finding it cool,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "That\u2019s the extravagant world of my superfun pop rule!"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}